  concept: 'Authored objective: Construct Twelve-Layer Network.

    Authored requirement:
    172 verified routes + 56 verified vias

    General teaching principle: PCB acceptance
    depends on the authored footprints, nets, layers, clearances and route constraints;
    visual appearance alone is insufficient.

    Only fresh, authoritative game
    evidence can establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: A multilayer road map helps visualize routing, but electrical continuity
    and constraints still require checks.
